  "title": "Chef John's Deviled Eggs",
  "description": "Chef John's deviled eggs recipe is fairly standard, except he adds a little cream cheese. Unlike mayonnaise, cream cheese firms up when chilled, and provides a more luxurious texture.",
  "authors": [
    "John Mitzewich"
  ],
